# Pass "studio": Anima Song in the owner's photographic colony, for the images of the Workshop page (PUBLICATION.md).
#
# Select it with -DepMap wsl-deps.studio.map, in English (the page is English). A named map REPLACES the default one, so the film tool is
# repeated. The tools are PickleTools': the studio (the fixture `nelim-zen-meadow-studio`, its camera presets and its presentation
# mode), the screenshot mode (developer mode turned off for a capture that keeps the interface), and the clear screen (no other
# mod's window over the picture). The scenarios that need them are tagged @requires:nelim.pickletools.screenshotstudio and are
# skipped in every other pass.
nelim.pickletools.filmticks         path:PickleTools/FilmTicks/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotstudio  path:PickleTools/ScreenshotStudio/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotmode    path:PickleTools/ScreenshotMode/Mod
nelim.pickletools.clearscreen       path:PickleTools/ClearScreen/Mod
